      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like, at minimum, you only really need VRC+ to create the group and change group owners; preventing users from changing things in the group because they ran out of VRC+ seems a bit counterproductive. At least let the users add more or switch through already uploaded images. I understand if there are reasons why it's like this, but seems like a con for groups.",
