  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "group owners should be able to update our groups banner, galleries and icon without vrc+ just like how they can already update the name, description, ect\n\nI get groups are a major selling point for plus, so maybe as a compromise limit this to one change a month per group?",
